SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Libra Season
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin us for an intentional astrological discussion
  and ritual for Libra season\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energe
 tic shift occurs.\n\nLearning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions wit
 h the sun is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\nLibra season i
 s from 9/22 - 10/23 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological 
 happenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (b
 irth chart recommended).\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting into your
  body is important.\n\nTogether we'll ground into the energy through medit
 ation and movement themed around the season.\nAccommodations/Modification 
 can be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\n\nWe'll close out with time
  for journaling and optional sharing.\n\nCash \\|\\| venmo \\|\\| Card are
  all accepted at the door also
