SUMMARY:Full Moon Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin Senseful Wellness in the Botanical Gardens fo
 r some astrology explanation and a Full Moon inspired yoga flow.\nMeet Sen
 seful Wellness in the Botanical Gardens for a yoga class themed around the
  Full moon.\n\nTogether we will :\n\\- Discuss what the Full Moon is askin
 g from us\n\\- Flow through a Full Moon inspired sequence\n\\- Journal & R
 eflect on the Full Moon\n\nWhat to bring:\nJournal & Pen\nWater\n\nWe will
  have Yoga Mats and additional props but you are welcome to bring your own
 .\n\nThis is a Donation Based Event\nRecommended Donation $15 - $25
