SUMMARY:Autumn Witch Mini Day Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\n[Get Your Tickets Here](https://www.eventbrite.com
 /e/witchy-ways-day-retreat-tickets-1996341264462)\n**Calling in all healer
 s\, plant parents\, mothers\, artists\, mystics\, rebels\, and seekers.**\
 nThis day is an invitation to remember and return to all that you are.\n\n
 Together\, we’ll spend an autumn afternoon slowing down\, dropping in\, 
 and reconnecting with ourselves\, the season\, and one another through rit
 ual\, reflection\, movement\, and a little witchcraft.\n\nAs we move throu
 gh the energies of fall\, we’ll explore the seasonal invitation to both 
 release what has run its course and intentionally call in what we’re rea
 dy to cultivate next.\n\n**Flow of the Day**\n*We’ll begin by gathering 
 in opening circle\, setting our intentions\, calling in the directions\, a
 nd grounding into the space through a guided meditation and energetic rele
 ase.*\n\n*From there\, we’ll move into a ceremonial teaching and transmi
 ssion\, exploring the astrological energies of Libra\, Scorpio\, and Sagit
 tarius alongside sacred feminine archetypes that can support us through th
 e shifting season. Guided journaling\, shadow reflection\, and group shari
 ng will offer space to bring these teachings into your own lived experienc
 e.*\n\n*After a nourishing snack break\, we’ll return to the body throug
 h intentional yoga and movement\, creating space for integration and embod
 iment.*\n\n*We’ll close our time together with a seasonal ritual. A litt
 le autumn witchcraft devoted to releasing what you’re ready to leave beh
 ind and calling in what you desire to cultivate. Through apple magic\, fir
 e\, candlelight\, and intention\, you’ll create a ritual piece to take h
 ome and continue tending throughout the season.*\n\n*Our gathering will co
 nclude with a closing prayer and circle\, sealing the magic of the day and
  honoring what has shifted\, opened\, or been remembered. Snacks and tea w
 ill be served.*\n\n**About your guides**\n**Jenn (She/Her)** is an intuiti
 ve healer trained Yoga Teacher 9+ years\, Reiki Master\, Astrologer and Sp
 iritual Coach. She combines her knowledge of the body from 13 years workin
 g in physical therapy with all spiritual tools that have contributed to he
 r own healing & spiritual journey to help guide others.\n**Vi (They/Them)*
 * is a practicing Witch & Psychic who is a trained Yoga Teacher\, Reiki Ma
 ster\, and Tarot Reader. They combine their passions of astrology\, divina
 tion\, dance\, and creative expression to help others listen to their intu
 ition.\n**Alessandra Mary (she/her)** is a ceremonialist\, Akashic prieste
 ss\, mystic\, author\, and sacred storyteller devoted to the path of remem
 brance. Through sacred gatherings and oracular transmissions\, she weaves 
 soulful experiences that invite you into deeper connection with synchronic
 ity\, authenticity\, and the unseen magic woven through everyday life. She
  stewards the land we will be gathering on.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: Pre-registra
 tion is required for this event to honor the capacity of the space.** If y
 ou would like to skip the fees\, you can Venmo us $60 [here](https://venmo
 .com/u/iamalessandramary "https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary")
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/senseful-soul-s-asheville-healing-com
