SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Scorpio Season
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energetic sh
 ift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun
  is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\nScorpio season is from 
 10/23 - 11/21 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happen
 ings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (birth c
 hart recommended not required).\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting in
 to your body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy through m
 editation and somatic movement themed around the season.\nAccommodations/M
 odification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\nWe'll close ou
 t with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n\n***Bring:***\n\nComfor
 table clothes to move in\nJournal and pen\nBirth chart if you have it\nwat
 er bottle\n\nCash \\|\\| Venmo \\|\\| Card are all accepted at the door al
 so
